Step-by-Step Process
  
1. Finger Movement

The user bends their fingers while wearing the glove.

2. Sensor Detection

Flex sensors change resistance depending on bend angle.

3. Data Processing

Arduino Nano converts sensor readings into usable values.

4. Wireless Transmission

The transmitter sends the data through the RF module.

5. Signal Reception

The receiver Arduino receives and processes the data.

6. Servo Control

Servo motors move the robotic arm based on the received values.
